✔ E1 replay seeds retain both real h001 decisions and leave conditional proposals unscored (65.067542ms)
✔ replay excludeCandidateIds rejects intersections and accepts disjoint candidate sets (0.481459ms)
✔ replay candidateIdsExact compares sets independently of order and rejects missing or extra candidates (0.149458ms)
✔ replay rejects unknown match fields rather than ignoring their requirements (0.768ms)
✔ replay validates every matching alternative before any model call (6.023625ms)
